  "problem": "The reciprocal of $\\frac{5}{2}$ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{2}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{2}{5}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $\\frac{5}{2}$ is $\\frac{2}{5}.$",
